 "introductions": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "作品概要",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "ある日、目覚めたらそこは――「魔界」だった!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nちょっとHなイベントのある、コンパクトでオーソドックスなRPGです。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n小さくて平和な魔界。<br />\r\nサイドビュー戦闘、キャラ育成、レア装備、合成ショップ!<br />\r\n昔懐かしいRPGの楽しみをぎゅっと詰め込みました。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "ゲーム詳細",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "こじんまりとしたオーソドックスなRPGにちょっとエッチなイベントがあるゲームです。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n元々はCG集のオマケのつもりでちょっとしたRPG作ってたらそこそこの規模になっちゃいました。<br />\r\nRPGツクールも初使用で何が出来るか等、色々試してます。<br />\r\n特にストーリーはないです。ある程度の道筋はあるけど基本は自由行動!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nレベル上げて、強い武器手に入れて、新しい街&amp;ダンジョンに行って・・・というRPGの基本原則を<br />\r\n小さく詰め込んでまとめてみました。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nプレイのしやすさにはそれなりに配慮したつもりですが、完全に一人で作ってる為<br />\r\n色々気づかない点も多いかと思います。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nご意見等いただければ、次回作に活かしていきたいです!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "Summary",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "One day, I woke up and found myself in the \"Demon World\"!<br />\n<br />\nA traditional RPG with a few H-scenes, taking place in a small and peaceful Demon World.<br />\n<br />\nIt's jam-packed with things from classic RPGs, like side-view battles, character leveling, rare equipment, and a synthesis store!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "Game Details",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "A traditional RPG with a few H-scenes.<br />\n<br />\nOriginally, I was making a little RPG as a bonus for a CG collection I made, but it ended up being quite large.<br />\nIt's my first time using RPG Maker, so I tried out a lot of things to see what I could do.<br />\nThere's no particular story. There is a certain path to follow, but you're basically free to do what you want!<br />\n<br />\nI tried to add the basics of an RPG into a small package: leveling, obtaining stronger weapons, and going to new towns and dungeons.<br />\n<br />\nI wanted to make it as easy to play as possible, but I'm sure I've made some missteps since I developed the game entirely by myself.<br />\n<br />\nIf you have any feedback, I'd like to take it into account for my next game!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "連絡先",
   "body": [
    {
